meta {
  name: Get product by id
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/master/products/{{lastProductId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # GET /master/products/:id

  Devuelve envelope `{data: {...}}` con el product completo.

  **Shape real del backend (hallazgo forense 2026-04-22):**
  ```
  {id, tenant_id, sku, name, description, category, unit_of_measure,
   weight, volume, requires_refrigeration (0|1), min_temperature, max_temperature,
   handling_instructions, customer_id, status, created_at, updated_at}
  ```

  Backend persiste MAS campos de los documentados en 10_BUGS_CONSOLIDADOS.md — revisar el transformer.
}
